aracterName":"イオナサル・ククルル・プリシェール","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c47272"},"originalCharacterName":"イオナサル・ククルル・プリシェール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"78"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Plus, I think I'd be better at making a bomb than a pickaxe!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Singer: Akiko Shikata"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ciel Nosurge Description:"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of Ciel nosurge, and the empress candidate of the Tenmon (Astronomical faction) group. Unsure of herself, she wants to do what she can to save Ra Ciela but lacks conviction at first, especially compared to the fiery and determined Kanon. Ion is quite the gearhead, and loves tinkering with machinery."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ciel Nosurge Summary"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ar Nosurge Description:"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nicknamed Ion, her actual name is Ionasal kkll Preciell."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"This girl is said to know the truths of the world. She has no allegiances to anyone, but her current location is unknown."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is somewhat awkward, and loves to tinker with machines."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Whenever she has the chance, she gathers strange materials together to create devices of unknown purpose."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the English official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c47272"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/17f31980a0b17cfc61e3eecb000e44d4833756879839ae798defcb456727cde0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/ab64661cba5fe95866c6e1ab28096b2b46b86462011b3e85b36f699b9bc223b4.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"加隈 亜衣","creatorId":"vndb:s603","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s603","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s603","name":"加隈 亜衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58558","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c47278","characterName":"ネィアフラスク","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c47278"},"originalCharacterName":"ネィアフラスク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Everyone, remain calm! Nay the Gale is here!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Singer: Haruka Shimotsuki"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nicknamed Nay, full name Nayaflask. She is friends with Delta, Casty and Sarly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She lives in Felion, but also shows up when the Sharl are attacked by humans."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It seems she assists everyone with a great deal of goodwill, and is quite popular."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It could be that her very straightforward attitude and blunt way of speaking are part of her overall popularity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the English official site"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Naya was the original Tenmon Empress Candidate, but lost her position and original body when Fractal removed her soul for the transmigration to give the body to the current Ion on Revelt's orders, and her soul was put into the body of a Sharl. She meets Ion, in hopes of getting revenge and reclaim her original body, but eventually becomes great friends with her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c47278"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0b5f0318682048cda6c2d79d65cf5f8893dd93f3fb19d505bd03621cfb8107d5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a58e237a06e239b2d5a28fb0c9c9aa7237136b2b16505093d156c84407e7f618.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"内田 真礼","creatorId":"vndb:s1326","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1326","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1326","name":"内田 真礼","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58560","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c47281","characterName":"ねりこ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c47281"},"originalCharacterName":"ねりこ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Well, that's rude. I'm Nelico, the glamorous, beautiful shopkeeper!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious woman who runs the general store near Ion's home."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She groans about being bored at every opportunity, and will always tease Ion if she has the chance."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A happy-go-lucky free spirit, she hates dull things and trouble, basically passing such issues on to others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She takes pride in her charming ears and in her drop-dead gorgeous body."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the English official site"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In reality, Nelico is a parasite attached to Ion's brain."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c47281"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3de670f5893c86261dbdc3fba8323c6cf32de5c1445814a674600bab6331da2c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bd30aa01c642757574f1112d80b04a09ae2465b53434c46a5cf7be8aab057583.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"MAKO","creatorId":"vndb:s1325","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1325","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1325","name":"MAKO","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58559","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60283","characterName":"カノイール・ククルル・プリシェール","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60283"},"originalCharacterName":"カノイール・ククルル・プリシェール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The empress candidate of the Chimon (Earthbound faction) group. Sophisticated, good at public speaking, and firm in her ideals, she wants to save Ra Ciela and at first thinks that Ion is too wishy-washy and weak to enact real change. She has a weakness for cute animals, especially birds, although she's embarrassed by it. Highly dignified, kind, and elegant."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ciel Nosurge Summary"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60283"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1ae00103590b428ea77265943df644083fdf07a0e93905a71d9bb9b7b635bfdc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/22/228310e52759a51ede1885d541cf9760ac5e5bcec38fd5a5a3a462122506a4ad.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"井ノ上 奈々","creatorId":"vndb:s1808","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1808","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1808","name":"井ノ上奈々","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58562","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60284","characterName":"キャスティ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60284"},"originalCharacterName":"キャスティ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young girl from the town of Manjusara who is friends with Tabou. Haughty and arrogant at first, she's a good person underneath her cold exterior, you could call her a tsundere."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ciel Nosurge Summary"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60284"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec893066472c3260faf4127e40802dae038256b3fbd398309a205906e35957e6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/232d2a7076bd8b3fc8025486fa63ca60c9123f6e8991b468120fad8eaf242aec.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水瀬 いのり","creatorId":"vndb:s5082","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5082","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5082","name":"水瀬 いのり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58563","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60285","characterName":"ジリリウム","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60285"},"originalCharacterName":"ジリリウム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":true,"text":"Singer: Noriko Mitose"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A genius researcher aligned with the Chimon faction who aims to create a world where everyone lives in harmony as Sharl-like creatures that lack individual free will. She will stop at nothing to achieve her goals."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is in love with Undu, a researcher who currently inhabits Nero's body after he lost his in an accident. Her secondary goal is to rescue him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ciel Nosurge Summary"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60285"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c293ae1b8f7497f01a0fb7977adbdc619d0e77eedc672912682035c4a4b395e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b2191dc78371f3e06fe2e5c359965291548e9736a47bc4c33b86873763982674.webp","width":216,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"川﨑 芽衣子","creatorId":"vndb:s10071","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10071","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10071","name":"川﨑 芽衣子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58565","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60286","characterName":"ター坊","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60286"},"originalCharacterName":"ター坊","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young boy from the town of Manjusara who saves Ion. Childhood friends with Casty, he always rushes into danger to help his friends and cheers them up however he can. Headstrong but a bit thickheaded. Ta-bou is a nickname from the last syllable of his real name, Delta. 'De-ru-ta', 'ta-bou', 'bou' being a nickname for young boys like him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ciel Nosurge Summary"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60286"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e79ff15bff0f101e679740332e9df8acd9e21ef4ed38645f533c2523eea61c